  "ownerHeader.replayAppTour": "Replay app tour",
  "ownerHeader.scans": "Scans",
  "ownerOnboarding.activityBody": "Quick questions to track health. Pet sitters are asked to run a health check daily. Flags show up fast when something's off.",
  "ownerOnboarding.activityHeadline": "Daily health checks.",
  "ownerOnboarding.addAnytime": "You can add a bird anytime from Home — tap the ? to revisit the tour.",
  "ownerOnboarding.addMyFirstBird": "Add my first bird",
  "ownerOnboarding.back": "Back",
  "ownerOnboarding.exploreBody": "What The Kya Project is up to. Field notes, deep dives, community and other ways to get involved. Read when you have a minute.",
  "ownerOnboarding.exploreHeadline": "Stories, education, conservation.",
  "ownerOnboarding.flockBody": "Tap a bird to see their care plan, weight history, journal, identity, and photos. The works.",
  "ownerOnboarding.flockHeadline": "Each bird gets a record.",
  "ownerOnboarding.fostersBody": "They live here while they're with you — until they're adopted, or until you decide they're staying. (It happens.)",
  "ownerOnboarding.fostersHeadline": "Fostering a bird?",
  "ownerOnboarding.gotIt": "Got it",
  "ownerOnboarding.handoffBody": "When a bird moves to a new home their full record can transfer with them. Care plan, history, identity, everything.",
  "ownerOnboarding.handoffHeadline": "Saying goodbye? Hand off the record.",
  "ownerOnboarding.hiName": "Hi, {{name}}.",
  "ownerOnboarding.homeBody": "Here you'll find daily check-ins, your flock, and anything happening soon. It's the screen you'll open most.",
  "ownerOnboarding.homeHeadline": "Home is where you land.",
