  "sitterOnboarding.step.cp.health": "{{name}}'s normal baseline and any conditions.",
  "sitterOnboarding.step.cp.home": "{{name}}'s environment and what to watch for.",
  "sitterOnboarding.step.dailyChecklist": "Work through {{name}}'s tasks here — grouped by morning, midday, and evening — and check them off as you go.",
  "sitterOnboarding.step.emergencyNav": "And if something's ever wrong, the Emergency button is always here. When in doubt, reach out — it's better to check.",
  "sitterOnboarding.step.guideNav": "The basics of parrot care, in plain language — general info for all parrots.",
  "sitterOnboarding.step.guideSearch": "Search here to find anything fast.",
  "sitterOnboarding.step.guideTopics": "Or tab through these topics to browse by subject.",
